sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Guardian
  participant W as Web dashboard
  participant S as Hono server
  participant A as Agent runner
  participant T as Sentinel
  participant C as Channel adapter
  U->>W: Send message
  W->>S: POST /api/webchat/turn
  S->>A: start turn(sessionId)
  activate A
  loop Tool calls
    A->>A: model step
    alt needs approval
      A->>T: check outbound action
      T-->>A: held
      A-->>W: approval request (SSE)
      U->>W: Approve
      W->>S: POST /api/approvals/:id
      S->>T: release
    else allowed
      A->>C: send
      C-->>A: receipt
    end
  end
  A-->>S: turn complete
  deactivate A
  S-->>W: stream final message
  Note over W,S: Checkpoint saved per turn
